WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.331
Tina: Really, Bello? You're willing to come to my world?

2
00:00:15.332 --> 00:00:17.015
Bello: Of course I am.

3
00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:20.204
I was just a little boy when you came to my world.

4
00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:25.585
Bello: But I have always remembered how you helped me and my father.

5
00:00:25.586 --> 00:00:29.129
Tina: You were just like my baby brother─only bigger.

6
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:33.067
Tina: I had fun looking after you. Danny did too.

7
00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:35.375
Bello: Yes, we had a lot of fun.

8
00:00:35.376 --> 00:00:38.120
And now it is my turn to help Danny.

9
00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:41.187
Tina: I hope he will listen to you, Bello.

10
00:00:41.188 --> 00:00:47.227
Hopian: Danny might be acting mean now, but he's a good boy, really.

11
00:00:47.228 --> 00:00:52.571
Hopian: Bello will remind him of all the good he did for Ginormous.

12
00:00:52.572 --> 00:00:55.668
Hopian: He'll want to be good again.

13
00:00:55.669 --> 00:00:57.449
Bello: I'll do my best.

14
00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.627
I'm looking forward to seeing your world, Tina.

15
00:01:00.628 --> 00:01:08.530
Hopian: Ever since his short visit as a baby, Bello has wanted [n3@to see your world again.

16
00:01:08.531 --> 00:01:11.036
Bello: It will be strange and wonderful.

17
00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:14.907
Everything will seem so small this time!

18
00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:20.961
Hopian: Bello, you must remember to be very careful.

19
00:01:20.962 --> 00:01:25.138
Bello: Sometimes my dad still thinks I'm a little kid.

20
00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:26.964
Tina: Don't worry, Hopian.

21
00:01:26.965 --> 00:01:33.051
I'm a good babysitter.

22
00:01:33.052 --> 00:01:36.887
Bello: Tina, you haven't told us how you traveled to our world.

23
00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:39.219
Tina: I used my imagination.

24
00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:43.298
Like your dad told us, imagination is the key.

25
00:01:43.299 --> 00:01:47.056
Hopian: How did you use your imagination, Tina?

26
00:01:47.057 --> 00:01:49.258
Tina: I had to concentrate hard.

27
00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:51.323
That was important.

28
00:01:51.324 --> 00:01:53.187
Hopian: What else?

29
00:01:53.188 --> 00:01:56.301
Tina: I knew that I wasn't good at art like Danny.

30
00:01:56.302 --> 00:01:59.715
Tina: So I concentrated on something that I like to do.

31
00:01:59.716 --> 00:02:02.213
Tina: Something I am good at.

32
00:02:02.214 --> 00:02:04.109
Bello: And what was that?

33
00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:07.310
Tina: Running! I ran as fast as the wind.

34
00:02:07.311 --> 00:02:11.505
Tina: There was a big storm, and a bolt of lightning almost hit me.

35
00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:13.988
Tina: But I kept running and jumping.

36
00:02:13.989 --> 00:02:17.223
I kept believing that I could reach you.

37
00:02:17.224 --> 00:02:20.511
Tina: And here I am!

38
00:02:20.512 --> 00:02:26.016
Hopian: And how do you and Bello plan to get back to your world?

39
00:02:26.017 --> 00:02:28.372
Tina: I hadn't thought that far ahead.

40
00:02:28.373 --> 00:02:30.913
Do you have any ideas, Hopian?

41
00:02:30.914 --> 00:02:40.188
Hopian: Perhaps. Let's go into the backyard.

42
00:02:40.189 --> 00:02:44.587
Tina: Gosh, I remember when we fought the dragonfly here.

43
00:02:44.588 --> 00:02:46.901
Tina: The garden was all gray then.

44
00:02:46.902 --> 00:02:50.398
Hopian: It looks better now, doesn't it?

45
00:02:50.399 --> 00:02:53.266
Tina: It's gorgeous.

46
00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:57.061
Bello: It looks better thanks to you, Danny, and Brad.

47
00:02:57.062 --> 00:02:59.993
Hopian: Look at the sky, Tina.

48
00:02:59.994 --> 00:03:02.563
Tina: That blue is incredible.

49
00:03:02.564 --> 00:03:05.689
And the sun is so yellow.

50
00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:15.795
Hopian: Look over there, past the trees and above the mountain.

51
00:03:15.796 --> 00:03:18.452
Tina: But . . . but that's impossible!

52
00:03:18.453 --> 00:03:21.598
Rainbows occur only after it rains!

53
00:03:21.599 --> 00:03:27.302
Hopian: The rainbow has never faded after all these years.

54
00:03:27.303 --> 00:03:35.970
Hopian: It has stayed the same since the day you and your friends left.

55
00:03:35.971 --> 00:03:38.036
Tina: But . . . how?

56
00:03:38.037 --> 00:03:41.742
Hopian: It's a magical rainbow.

57
00:03:41.743 --> 00:03:46.920
Tina: And Bello and I can use the rainbow to travel back to my world?

58
00:03:46.921 --> 00:03:55.215
Hopian: I knew you would figure it out!
